{"id":"adee8e90809320b8","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-variable.md","title":"一阶支撑语言的变量","display":"df-variable — 一阶支撑语言的变量","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-variable","aliases":["18-df-variable"],"display":"df-variable — 一阶支撑语言的变量","depends_on":["[[18-df-symbol-alphabet]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"4.2.1 (comparison)","source_printed_pages":"46–47","source_pdf_pages":"56–57","source_correspondence":"supplementary-first-order-interface","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13","local_revision":"2026-10-14","local_review_scope":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification","source_statement_status_scope":"inherited pre-revision record; not a new source check"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-variable — 一阶支撑语言的变量"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca728af2af9b9d11\" href=\"?note=ca728af2af9b9d11\" title=\"18-df-symbol-alphabet\">18-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"4.2.1 (comparison)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"46–47"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"56–57"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"supplementary-first-order-interface"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"local_review_scope","html":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification"},{"key":"source_statement_status_scope","html":"inherited pre-revision record; not a new source check"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本节点使用统一变量的一阶支撑语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 及其两两不交的符号分量、单射且互斥的有限树构造子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca728af2af9b9d11\" href=\"?note=ca728af2af9b9d11\" title=\"18-df-symbol-alphabet\">18-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathbb N\\xrightarrow{\\sim}V\">\\(v:\\mathbb N\\xrightarrow{\\sim}V\\)</span> 是该字母表固定的变量枚举，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_n=v(n)\">\\(v_n=v(n)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}=V\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}=V\\)</span> 是其变量分量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 是常量分量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_n,R_n\">\\(F_n,R_n\\)</span> 为正元函数、关系分量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\\coloneqq v[\\mathbb N]=\\{v_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Const}(S)\\coloneqq C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Var}_S\\coloneqq v[\\mathbb N]=\\{v_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Const}(S)\\coloneqq C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\ge1\\quad\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\coloneqq F_n,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\coloneqq R_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\ge1\\quad\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\coloneqq F_n,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\coloneqq R_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节点明确为补充支撑接口。原书 Definition 4.2.1 区分自由/绑定对象变量及自由/绑定关系变量；此统一变量接口没有形式化全部二阶语法，不能据此声称原书整个语法已忠实编码。所引用字母表提供有限树构造子的唯一解析条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"ca728af2af9b9d11","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"ca728af2af9b9d11","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本节点使用统一变量的一阶支撑语言；$S$ 及其两两不交的符号分量、单射且互斥的有限树构造子见 [[18-df-symbol-alphabet]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"v:\\mathbb N\\xrightarrow{\\sim}V","display":false},{"tex":"v_n=v(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}=V","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"F_n,R_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_S\\coloneqq v[\\mathbb N]=\\{v_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Const}(S)\\coloneqq C.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\ge1\\quad\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\coloneqq F_n,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\coloneqq R_n.","display":true}],"bytes":1717,"backlinks":[{"id":"95cd5e4d0506772c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$ 见 [[18-df-structure]]，$\\mathrm{Var}_S$ 见 [[18-df-variable]]。"},{"id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S,\\mathrm{Var}_S$ 及互斥构造树见 [[18-df-variable]]；$\\mathrm{Term}_S$、$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$ 分别为 [[18-df-term]]、[[18-df-atomic-formula]] 的项与原子公式集合，变量集取 $\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\mathrm{Var}$。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-88","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-variable]]"},{"id":"fe2ed372063cc94a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9ac3a6265513490d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S,C,F_n,R_n$ 为 [[18-df-variable]] 的固定签名分量；集合元语言见 [[18-df-set]]。"},{"id":"01ff954c42fa05a6","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Term}_S$ 为 [[18-df-term]] 的有限项树，变量集与 [[18-df-variable]] 相同。"},{"id":"a51b88c3e3a72ba5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S,V,C,F_n$ 及构造子见 [[18-df-symbol-alphabet]]，变量接口见 [[18-df-variable]]，$\\mathrm{Var}_S=V$。$j,n\\in\\omega$；函数符号仅在其指定元数上应用。$x,c,f(\\vec t)$ 采用字母表节点的项位置显示约定。"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-110","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-variable]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-variable|18-df-variable]]"}],"outgoing":["ca728af2af9b9d11"]}